WEBVTT

00:05.643 --> 00:08.373
You're a user of magnetic power!

00:08.446 --> 00:09.936
Very clever.

00:20.424 --> 00:21.322
This is it!

00:24.262 --> 00:28.665
Your attack doesn't bother me
at all as long as I can see it!

00:29.033 --> 00:31.058
It may not work on you...

00:31.135 --> 00:34.127
...but I bet my punch
would really work on her.

00:35.339 --> 00:38.103
I think you're mistaken.

00:38.175 --> 00:40.643
Now, don't move.

00:40.778 --> 00:42.973
You're the one that shouldn't move.

00:43.047 --> 00:43.604
What?!

00:44.782 --> 00:47.808
Gale Force Wind!

00:53.724 --> 00:57.251
A-are you...

00:57.528 --> 00:58.552
Take this!

00:58.629 --> 01:00.654
My Magnetic Punch!

01:00.731 --> 01:02.722
Ow! Ow! That's hot!

01:03.534 --> 01:04.796
Hot?

01:05.036 --> 01:05.968
Flames?

01:20.418 --> 01:23.444
It looks like the repairs
to the buildings are about done.

01:24.689 --> 01:25.519
Right.

01:26.190 --> 01:27.521
That's good.

01:30.461 --> 01:31.189
Wh-What?!

01:32.730 --> 01:35.722
It's not often that I see you
looking so calm.

01:35.800 --> 01:36.732
Wha...?!

01:37.201 --> 01:39.965
Anyway, you should get
some more rest.

01:40.604 --> 01:41.036
Huh?

01:42.606 --> 01:43.868
Didn't you hear me?

01:44.742 --> 01:47.108
I said you should rest up
some more.

01:48.312 --> 01:51.304
I never thought you could be
so sensitive.

01:51.415 --> 01:52.609
What did you say?!

01:53.584 --> 01:55.279
I'd get into this with you...

01:55.353 --> 01:58.186
...but I've got more important things
to think about.

01:58.289 --> 01:59.586
Did something happen?!

02:00.191 --> 02:01.715
We can't find Ginnosuke.

02:02.293 --> 02:03.783
I've got to look for him.

02:04.261 --> 02:05.421
Nerdy guy...

02:06.230 --> 02:07.322
Don't worry.

02:08.432 --> 02:11.128
I'm sure he just got lost
somewhere around here.

02:13.838 --> 02:15.328
Anyway, you get your rest.

02:15.840 --> 02:17.330
Once we find Ginnosuke...

02:17.408 --> 02:18.966
...we'll leave right away.

02:19.243 --> 02:20.005
Right...

02:34.058 --> 02:35.252
Who are you?

02:35.760 --> 02:38.854
It seems like the modifications
have made it more powerful...

02:38.929 --> 02:41.454
...but it's not very accurate.

02:43.234 --> 02:44.758
A gun?

02:48.038 --> 02:48.936
Um...

02:49.673 --> 02:50.833
Oh, right.

02:50.908 --> 02:52.637
I don't know who you are...

02:52.710 --> 02:54.109
...but I'm sorry for scaring you.

02:56.781 --> 02:58.942
I am Sui.

02:59.316 --> 03:02.717
I just happened to see you
being chased down...

03:02.787 --> 03:04.516
...by that Company agent.

03:04.789 --> 03:09.123
Be careful of the warriors
hanging around these parts.

03:10.461 --> 03:11.894
Good-bye.

03:33.617 --> 03:37.314
The city at night is so cold

03:37.388 --> 03:40.915
I feel like I'm going to lose my mind

03:40.991 --> 03:44.392
I wonder if I can keep going

03:44.462 --> 03:47.158
The important thing...

03:47.231 --> 03:49.529
You must tell me

03:49.600 --> 03:51.067
Please

03:51.302 --> 03:56.205
Do people meet only so
they can part one day?

03:56.273 --> 04:01.609
Tell me that's not true

04:01.679 --> 04:05.479
I loved you so much that it hurt

04:05.549 --> 04:09.076
Everything was sparkling all around

04:09.153 --> 04:12.520
There was nothing to be afraid of

04:12.590 --> 04:16.253
I believed in that

04:16.327 --> 04:19.922
That moment when
my passions stirred

04:19.997 --> 04:23.364
To the point where I thought
I would fall apart

04:23.434 --> 04:26.835
I will never forget that moment

04:26.904 --> 04:30.362
I will never say I want to go back

04:30.441 --> 04:36.380
I just want to see you one more time

04:50.227 --> 04:53.430
The Spirit Gun - To Fight Together
The Spirit Gun - To Fight Together.

04:53.430 --> 04:57.093
The Spirit Gun - To Fight Together

05:03.040 --> 05:05.474
A problem with the...

05:05.543 --> 05:08.239
Target... Target control...

05:12.383 --> 05:13.680
That kid.

05:14.184 --> 05:16.243
That's the kid from before.

05:17.888 --> 05:21.380
What is that creepy look
he's giving me?

05:21.959 --> 05:23.483
It must be my imagination.

05:23.894 --> 05:25.987
He's just going the same way.

05:31.402 --> 05:32.391
Ginnosuke!

05:33.604 --> 05:36.573
I didn't want to worry Blondie
but this could be bad!

05:37.141 --> 05:38.335
Hey!

05:39.877 --> 05:41.367
There's big trouble!

05:53.524 --> 05:55.651
What's with this kid, anyway?

06:03.567 --> 06:05.125
Uh, he's not hiding himself well at all.

06:09.540 --> 06:12.202
Is that the trouble
you were talking about?

06:12.276 --> 06:13.971
You can save her!

06:14.044 --> 06:16.478
It's too high and she can't get down!

06:17.147 --> 06:18.910
I'm scared!

06:20.217 --> 06:22.117
How did she get up there?

06:32.529 --> 06:33.518
He's still there.

06:35.833 --> 06:38.825
I've never seen that kid before.

06:39.003 --> 06:41.665
And why was the Company
after him?

06:44.608 --> 06:46.235
That unusual gun...

06:47.277 --> 06:51.737
It's so small but it was able to take
down a man with its flame power.

06:52.716 --> 06:53.978
If I had that...

06:54.284 --> 06:56.275
Is that what this is about?

06:57.755 --> 07:02.818
You've been following me because
you're interested in this gun.

07:03.761 --> 07:06.753
You want to learn about
the Spirit Gun.

07:07.665 --> 07:08.859
Spirit Gun?

07:11.001 --> 07:13.731
Damn! I've got to find
Ginnosuke quick!

08:03.754 --> 08:05.278
The waterfall...

08:05.489 --> 08:08.014
When they sealed off this place...

08:08.092 --> 08:11.061
...this was something
the researchers left behind.

08:11.428 --> 08:13.953
Flame and water,
ice and lightning...

08:14.098 --> 08:17.295
By firing rounds infused with
the power of those elements...

08:17.367 --> 08:21.326
...even those without special
powers can control them.

08:22.272 --> 08:24.604
I was getting sick and tired...

08:24.675 --> 08:27.701
...of watching Company thugs
have their way in the villages.

08:27.778 --> 08:31.680
So I've been fighting back while
also working on improvements.

08:31.982 --> 08:32.778
This is it!

08:33.817 --> 08:35.216
Please!

08:35.552 --> 08:36.450
No!

08:36.620 --> 08:37.143
Huh?!

08:37.855 --> 08:40.449
I can't give this to you.

08:43.660 --> 08:44.524
Then...

08:44.595 --> 08:48.190
Then, please show me
how to build a Spirit Gun!

08:48.332 --> 08:48.923
What?

08:49.133 --> 08:52.398
Y-You want to build
a Spirit Gun?

08:52.936 --> 08:54.460
I'm so sorry.

08:54.538 --> 08:57.063
We crash into each other and...

08:57.141 --> 08:59.234
...you help me pick everything up.

08:59.309 --> 09:01.607
Then you help with my shopping...

09:01.678 --> 09:05.045
...and even offer to carry
everything home for me!

09:05.115 --> 09:06.844
Are you sure it's not too heavy?

09:07.918 --> 09:09.283
Oh, this is nothing.

09:09.620 --> 09:13.522
You sure are someone
who can be counted on.

09:16.059 --> 09:17.492
Sorry, Ginnosuke.

09:20.597 --> 09:22.895
It's because I'm so weak...

09:24.201 --> 09:27.728
Am I going to be able to
rescue Ruri like this?

09:28.772 --> 09:33.607
I'm sure Ruri is locked
in that room all by herself.

09:33.811 --> 09:35.039
Ruri...

09:39.283 --> 09:40.250
The moon?

09:40.317 --> 09:41.784
Yes, the moon.

09:42.286 --> 09:44.846
So, there're things like that
on the surface?

09:44.922 --> 09:46.753
And it's not just the moon, either.

09:46.824 --> 09:47.791
On the surface...

09:47.858 --> 09:50.326
...there are so many things
that just don't exist here.

09:51.028 --> 09:53.258
I'm sure you saw some of them.

09:53.964 --> 09:55.158
It's not like...

09:55.866 --> 09:58.357
It's not like I went there
to play around.

09:58.735 --> 09:59.724
Hey, Shiel.

10:00.337 --> 10:00.860
Huh?

10:01.772 --> 10:04.332
I'm sure it's just like that meal.

10:05.742 --> 10:07.937
Even if you're doing
the same thing...

10:08.011 --> 10:11.412
...you can experience it differently
depending on...

10:11.481 --> 10:14.314
...who you're with and
how you feel at the time.

10:15.285 --> 10:16.115
Ruri...

10:20.090 --> 10:22.024
The surface, huh?

10:28.265 --> 10:29.698
A surface dweller!

10:30.167 --> 10:31.191
I see.

10:31.501 --> 10:34.527
That explains the unusual clothing
you're wearing.

10:37.007 --> 10:39.100
There's nothing to be
so worried about.

10:39.743 --> 10:42.041
It's not like everyone
in the Underground...

10:42.112 --> 10:45.878
...sees people from the surface
as the enemy.

10:46.717 --> 10:49.208
But, why do you want a Spirit Gun?

10:50.454 --> 10:51.682
This gun is...

10:51.755 --> 10:55.054
...made from components that
are virtually impossible to find.

10:55.993 --> 11:00.726
You want to search through
a pile of junk to find those parts?

11:00.797 --> 11:02.196
Yes, I do.

11:03.767 --> 11:07.396
I want that gun so that I can
help my friends fight the enemy...

11:07.471 --> 11:10.963
...and rescue the special person
they care so much about.

11:11.308 --> 11:14.402
I don't want to be the one
that holds them up!

11:18.081 --> 11:20.515
What if I was to say no?

11:29.626 --> 11:32.857
What if I was to say no?

11:34.598 --> 11:36.793
I won't give up trying
until you agree.

11:37.267 --> 11:38.564
All right, then.

11:38.869 --> 11:41.269
If you said that you wanted to take
the gun to the surface...

11:41.338 --> 11:42.999
...I would've sent you away.

11:43.907 --> 11:46.933
I'll give you a list of parts
you will need.

11:47.277 --> 11:48.369
Then...

11:50.414 --> 11:51.813
I wish you the best.

11:53.417 --> 11:54.850
Thank you very much!

11:55.419 --> 11:57.853
I'm sure this was some sort of fate.

11:58.622 --> 12:03.457
Besides, how could I refuse
someone who seems so determined.

12:03.527 --> 12:07.827
Oh, yes. Watch your footing
on the junk pile...

12:12.235 --> 12:13.759
Such determination...

12:14.438 --> 12:18.169
Perhaps, he's someone to watch.

12:21.912 --> 12:24.312
I'm glad no one was watching that...

12:26.483 --> 12:29.975
This time I'm going to have to get
on with searching for Ginnosuke!

12:34.057 --> 12:36.582
Hey, wind user guy!

12:36.994 --> 12:39.019
You came at just the right time!

12:40.063 --> 12:44.022
Come on, think you can
give us a little hand?

12:44.101 --> 12:45.625
We're having some trouble here.

12:55.846 --> 13:00.306
So I can help my friends
rescue that special person!

13:02.619 --> 13:05.019
Special person, huh?

13:06.823 --> 13:07.915
Those eyes...

13:09.493 --> 13:11.791
Had the same look as mine.

13:36.853 --> 13:38.377
The same look as back then.

13:49.232 --> 13:52.861
That was when the warriors
came to the village...

13:52.936 --> 13:54.836
...hunting those with powers.

14:01.278 --> 14:02.145
I was useless.

14:02.145 --> 14:03.703
- I was useless.
- Hexa!

14:04.181 --> 14:05.842
- The one so precious to me...
- Sui!

14:05.916 --> 14:11.684
...was taken away right before my eyes.

14:12.389 --> 14:13.686
Sui!

14:19.596 --> 14:21.154
If only I'd had a power.

14:22.299 --> 14:23.596
I wanted a power.

14:25.969 --> 14:29.166
I wanted a power that could
help me save my beloved!

14:31.808 --> 14:35.175
So I engaged in various
forms of training...

14:35.245 --> 14:36.906
...in the hopes of
acquiring a power.

14:40.517 --> 14:42.246
But in the end...

14:42.319 --> 14:44.810
...I only came to realize...

14:44.888 --> 14:50.451
...that there was nothing I could do
against the Company by myself.

15:00.737 --> 15:02.329
Ginnosuke!

15:05.976 --> 15:07.102
Where are you?!

15:10.580 --> 15:12.275
This isn't it, either...

15:22.225 --> 15:25.160
I've got to find it...

15:25.729 --> 15:27.993
I have to.

15:28.265 --> 15:29.596
Where is it?

15:39.943 --> 15:42.275
I'm not about to give up!

15:44.447 --> 15:48.042
Now, that's quite
the determined young man.

15:52.756 --> 15:56.317
You sure seem to be
having a tough time.

16:00.330 --> 16:02.958
Can I give you a hand?

16:03.567 --> 16:05.034
Uh, yes! Master!

16:06.036 --> 16:07.162
M-Master...?

16:24.788 --> 16:25.755
These are...!

16:28.091 --> 16:29.217
Ginnosuke...

16:35.765 --> 16:36.595
Oh, no...

16:40.604 --> 16:43.835
Ginnosuke!

16:50.280 --> 16:53.807
We've managed to gather up
all the components.

16:53.883 --> 16:56.511
I think you can build
a good Spirit Gun with this.

16:57.320 --> 16:58.514
Yes, Master.

17:11.201 --> 17:14.534
That gun may very well be
the best Spirit Gun...

17:14.604 --> 17:16.765
...that has been built so far.

17:16.840 --> 17:20.901
I want you to see with your own
eyes the true power of that gun.

17:22.979 --> 17:24.537
Go!

17:27.050 --> 17:27.880
Yes!

17:28.351 --> 17:29.340
You did it!

17:35.959 --> 17:37.449
Ginnosuke...

17:37.594 --> 17:38.288
Yes?

17:40.063 --> 17:44.090
Try not to use this gun too much.

17:44.167 --> 17:45.759
Seems a bit much.

17:45.902 --> 17:47.802
I think so...

17:57.547 --> 18:01.313
Anyway, we don't know
for sure that he's dead.

18:01.685 --> 18:03.380
There's still hope...

18:03.453 --> 18:04.647
Don't be stupid!

18:04.821 --> 18:06.755
There's no way he's dead!

18:06.823 --> 18:08.916
No one ever said that he's dead!

18:08.992 --> 18:10.152
Take it easy!

18:10.493 --> 18:11.653
You...!

18:13.296 --> 18:13.887
Huh?

18:17.934 --> 18:20.232
H-Hi, Rumina...

18:24.808 --> 18:26.435
Wh-Who're you?

18:26.810 --> 18:28.675
It's me! Ginnosuke!

18:28.745 --> 18:29.473
What?!

18:29.679 --> 18:30.873
Ginnosuke?!

18:31.448 --> 18:32.642
Sorry.

18:32.716 --> 18:37.449
You've always worn glasses
even back in kindergarten.

18:40.023 --> 18:42.423
But we've known each other for years!

18:42.926 --> 18:44.291
Sounds like him.

18:44.661 --> 18:46.390
You look wonderful.

18:46.763 --> 18:49.459
Well, you really had us worried.

18:49.532 --> 18:51.159
Where have you been all this time?

18:51.768 --> 18:53.395
Well, you see...

18:53.470 --> 18:55.597
I got caught up in some things.

18:56.539 --> 18:57.506
Here you go.

18:58.041 --> 18:59.633
I picked them up for you.

19:00.343 --> 19:01.833
Uh, thanks.

19:03.713 --> 19:06.876
I feel much better
with my glasses on.

19:07.450 --> 19:09.918
Well, how wonderful.

19:10.153 --> 19:10.812
Huh?

19:14.591 --> 19:15.455
All right!

19:15.825 --> 19:18.350
It's too bad you couldn't
stay a little longer.

19:18.628 --> 19:19.617
I feel bad.

19:19.696 --> 19:22.324
We caused you so much trouble.

19:24.534 --> 19:27.901
When we're done with our mission,
we'll come and visit.

19:27.971 --> 19:29.302
Right, Blondie?

19:32.041 --> 19:33.235
Of course!

19:33.343 --> 19:34.037
Bye!

19:57.133 --> 20:01.331
That wind user kid and Rorec,
the Maiden's former bodyguard.

20:01.871 --> 20:04.032
We brought the Maiden back...

20:04.107 --> 20:07.736
...but who would've thought
that they would've come here.

20:09.145 --> 20:13.411
I did tell you before,
that he would come.

20:14.184 --> 20:19.622
He was the first person
to ever put a scratch on my body.

20:21.191 --> 20:23.887
If I don't return the favor...

20:23.960 --> 20:25.951
...I don't think I'll be able
to contain my anger.

20:26.563 --> 20:30.124
Wind user, Rumina Asagi!

20:44.380 --> 20:49.249
Again, I walked the streets today

20:49.319 --> 20:55.224
I walked with purpose

20:55.291 --> 21:06.930
Through a city that looked
polished beyond belief

21:08.471 --> 21:19.314
Are you crying?
Those of you with such tiny pasts

21:19.382 --> 21:30.919
When you look up,
you see the sky on a digital screen

21:31.661 --> 21:40.569
The song of the wind...
I climb up the long staircase

21:40.637 --> 21:44.300
I tried to listen

21:44.374 --> 21:52.406
Hold me
The dream that gently wounded me

21:52.482 --> 22:01.254
Has faded away
Please don't cry

22:10.633 --> 22:12.567
Preview

22:12.802 --> 22:15.202
Wh-What is this giant hole,
anyway?

22:15.672 --> 22:19.472
Is it the "Underglobe"
that the Dragons created?

22:19.742 --> 22:21.471
What kind of monster...?

22:22.679 --> 22:24.340
I knew you'd show up!

22:24.681 --> 22:27.013
I guess we've
got to settle things!

22:27.216 --> 22:31.016
I'm not the same man you fought
last time, Rat-Tail!

22:31.588 --> 22:33.988
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:34.057 --> 22:35.658
..."The Revenge of the Water User".

22:35.658 --> 22:37.393
The Revenge of the Water User
..."The Revenge of the Water User".

22:37.393 --> 22:40.419
The Revenge of the Water User
